WEBVTT

00:42:59.875 --> 00:43:02.768
But it is very much the educational model

00:43:02.792 --> 00:43:05.684
of the large majority
of the world, actually.

00:43:05.708 --> 00:43:08.351
AG: So I've noticed
that maybe one of the manifestations

00:43:08.375 --> 00:43:09.851
of this upbringing for you is

00:43:09.875 --> 00:43:12.851
you are not at all shy
about asking other people for help.

00:43:12.875 --> 00:43:16.226
I think you're much bolder
about it than I typically am.

00:43:16.250 --> 00:43:19.476
And I was curious about whether
this is related to that dynamic.

00:43:19.500 --> 00:43:22.333
Are you unafraid of the rejection?

00:43:24.208 --> 00:43:27.309
EP: I would say it like this,
it is absolutely true.

00:43:27.333 --> 00:43:29.101
I ask for help a lot.

00:43:29.125 --> 00:43:34.143
I offer help a lot and I have
no fear when I ask for help.